; Valuation-footing detector fixture (test/semantic/footing.py).
; Two lots of AAPL bought on different dates, then a later price.  At
; the fixed --now, bal -V --unrealized and bal -X $ --unrealized must
; each total zero with <Unrealized> at $-300, minus the $300 of bal -G
; and of bal -G -X $.  The detector limits the -V report, and then the
; -X report, to Assets:Brokerage, which omits the other side of each
; purchase so that the total is $3100, and perturbs the final price in
; the copy that bal -G, and then bal -G -X $, reads alone, so that the
; gain is $320.

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $150
    Assets:Checking

2024/02/01 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $160
    Assets:Checking

P 2024/03/01 AAPL $170
